  "name": "@claudexor/mcp-server",
  "readme": "# @claudexor/mcp-server\n\nInternal package of [Claudexor](https://github.com/razzant/claudexor) \u2014 MCP server (official SDK, stdio) exposing daemon-backed durable run handles plus explicit status, result, cancel, and interaction tools. Experimental MCP Tasks are not advertised.\n\nPublished as part of the Claudexor toolchain; it follows the monorepo's\nlockstep version and has no separate semver contract. Use the `claudexor`\nCLI (or `@claudexor/cli`) as the supported entry point.\n",
  "readmeFilename": "README.md",
  "repository": {
   "directory": "packages/mcp-server",
   "type": "git",
   "url": "git+https://github.com/razzant/claudexor.git"
  },
